{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b4fdc7dd2d0a81a28044969c754916e5c5a8792973d27633290878d7eaab5d4e", "ja": "（人狼をモチーフにした百合子の新しい\n衣装が届いた。今は試着をしてもらっている）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "26719cfd8f63794e3b749e6afbd0483600aac68582b2dfcd7bc44ea1607b37ad", "ja": "{$P$}さん。この衣装、\n本当にいろんな魅力が詰まってますけど……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "ce7244d3fb4e91587bec916aa828c553639c8636e380ad1472069dafd03cb47e", "ja": "人狼がモチーフっていうところが素敵ですよね！\nがおー！　食べちゃうぞ～。なんちゃって……えへへ♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bc2f17028f3ba3ae188c346b838ee25e74b372b43203029550529b30ad040b6a", "ja": "ははっ。それがこの衣装の一番のウリだからな。\n気に入ってもらえて何よりだよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "8b1c99e1e28dc127ae1e2eecd3b82e962945a9f7840d822dc471e1ffa3d53cdb", "ja": "普段は人間に紛れて暮らしていて。けど、月の美しい夜\nには、抑えこんでいた本能が姿を現してしまうんです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "3765c76ba69ddc681626746e00ef67af577bd5079f0bd52fa9c47e94c0af2d56", "ja": "そう、それは人狼として生まれたからには、決して\n抗えぬ業。やがてその鋭い牙と爪は愛する人達に……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "af593fdf8a175df018cd14354bf0683c31c11af621af54b88bafc740f5a60aae", "ja": "自我と本能の狭間で苦しむ人狼の前に現れたのは……！\nって、ハッ！？　す、すみません……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1007_p", "source_sha256": "66e9d5c31d3e407929af9934a53f65e789c2aa88faef5b0f9559bc8210383b7a", "ja": "いや。百合子に任せてよかったよ。\nその衣装の良さを、しっかり引き出してくれそうだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "d218e1015567a5511cdcd67600242cf507c1beceb07b53cfc49745acbf7fbc42", "ja": "それなら任せてください！　次のライブに向けて\n人狼っぽい見せ方を考えてきたんです！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c13b9e22a1f7007a900b3120296e4e8d81892c8446e738563572e8399baba570", "ja": "おっ、そうなのか。\nどんなアイディアか聞いてもいいかな？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "d5ec9f718cc2f4eb42305253bbee37372191eb52ecd1b992ee332ea87cb64d9b", "ja": "はい！　あえて最初は、別の衣装で登場するんです。\nセットリストもポップで可愛い曲を中心にして……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "41a165d53da216b79e410eb3b8f8583d015de8359034b3259bc622c6a14b32dd", "ja": "みんながすっかりライブに夢中になった頃……\n突然、ステージが暗くなってダークな音楽が！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1012_p", "source_sha256": "60ab9f25615817ec6e81befe921c93114e8fa37b2eb8f87b9267559088f2f7ac", "ja": "満を持して人狼が登場！って事だな。\nなるほど、すごくいい演出じゃないか。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "fcbe71ff71c70cc63f2f412998c64f8fc6decd5adbef0cd6d07cd81f4e18ba0d", "ja": "あとは……ライブの途中に、\n伏線を張ってみるのも面白いかもしれませんね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b7db68d742f9747de39af430a123556c24256f97c0ce6e8be21c1df3f6d6b39", "ja": "照明が当たると、影だけオオカミに見えるとか、\n歌う曲も、だんだん怪しい雰囲気に寄せていって……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7c3e84b076608cafcc425561dfdcc68ba4e52f1bf5e7492e5cabb53ba3b3c11a", "ja": "おお、どれも面白そうだな。……この際だから、\n次の公演のプランとしてまとめてみようか。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "0c5f75af0a6487a698810021fdb7e653885d6469ae152d3ec4cb6150b7085846", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか！？　他にも、人狼のゲームに\n見立てたストーリー性のある案も考えてて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9b42bd4ba71d0f4529467f7ed9fa4759b1ecbbb59849aa50ea67fb26ffca1f8e", "ja": "一先ず、百合子の意見を聞かせてくれるか？　どこまで\nできるかは分からないけど……一緒に考えてみよう。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "46a00d94b4627c1bf9b13dd2d5b6f49972bb5d83dc6a27a1f5d5bb675cc9cfcd", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　素敵な衣装をいただけて、\nさらにはライブの演出まで……すごく嬉しいです！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "4a7a6f877ff2abee44439f12b87d1a27b616e3bbb1b955b0c0e9d3227502cdc4", "ja": "それでですね……。実は、ノートに、他のプランも\nまとめてて……。えへへ、あとで見てもらえますか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0754_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0754_1020_p", "source_sha256": "02ca52decebe03fb8dccd930d3684419b142fea3109d8ae889df58f5747a9e64", "ja": "（その後、百合子とふたりで徹底的にプランを詰めた。\nこれならファンのみんなに喜んでもらえそうだな！）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
